  m_text: "\nOBJECTIVE:\r\n\nScore the ping pong ball into all 6 cups before the
    timer runs out.\r\n\r\nCONTROLS:\r\n\nGrab Ball:                Hold Grip (Right
    Controller)\r\nThrow Ball:              Press A Button\r\nTeleport:                 
    Use Right Joystick\r\nReturn to \nStart Position           Press B Button\r\nRetry
    Game:            Press Retry Button on Menu\r\n\r\n\U0001F3D3TIPS:\r\nAim using
    the green trajectory line for accurate throws."
